            "review_title": "Review at Gogi House Aeon Mall",
            "review_text": "Ever I\n2 contributions\n0\nWait 90 minutes & never get your food.\nJul 2026 • Couples\nAbsolutely terrible. Menu broke several times. It's a tablet, and you order dishes one by one. We ordered 9 dishes to start and they bring us only 5 dishes. Asked for the other 4 dishes several times and they never came. \n\nWaited 90 minutes!!! Orders never came. We left early while still hungry. Never order from this place or you will be disappointed.\n\nStaff does not speak english either, so to not waste any more of my time there, we just paid and left. \n\nAbsolutely ridiculous.\n\nAlso, the seats they sat us down at still have food on them from the previous customers.\nRead more\nWritten July 3, 2026",
